{"id":"n64540-1-7","stage":1,"title":"대답 · 应答","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64540-1-7-1","ko":"할아버지가 부르시는데 대답을 빨리 안 해서 혼났어요.","zh":"爷爷叫我，我没快点回应，被骂了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"할아버지가","meaning":"爷爷，姥爷","explanation":"할아버지：爷爷，姥爷；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"할아버지","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74121","senseId":"1","lemma":"할아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할아버지가","audio":"/audio/82ad8267448225449e4e.mp3"}},{"text":"부르시는데","meaning":"请，叫","explanation":"부르다：请，叫；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"부르다","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57304","senseId":"9","lemma":"부르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부르시는데","audio":"/audio/f6606333e386e819f3b2.mp3"}},{"text":"대답을","meaning":"应答，回应，回复","explanation":"대답：应答，回应，回复；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"대답","audio":"/audio/bd8a8d233373a1c01779.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64540","senseId":"1","lemma":"대답","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대답을","audio":"/audio/ecb66b4a438d9b44aa67.mp3"}},{"text":"빨리","meaning":"快，赶快","explanation":"빨리：快，赶快。","readings":[{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57305","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"해서","meaning":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","explanation":"하다：表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"32","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해서","audio":"/audio/91cbeb2e0a1193dc2da9.mp3"}},{"text":"혼났어요.","meaning":"被大骂，被怒斥","explanation":"혼나다：被大骂，被怒斥；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"혼나다","audio":"/audio/b4d47e56735ffcb5a8a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87966","senseId":"2","lemma":"혼나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혼났어요","audio":"/audio/0e0980fa557b2790a3de.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6600340ce9e158e7","term":"할아버지","zh":"爷爷，姥爷","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3","entryId":"74121","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的父亲或母亲的父亲。","pronunciation":["하라버지"]},{"id":"169eb5d7a0d76e97","term":"부르다","zh":"请，叫","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3","entryId":"57304","definition":"请求对方过来。","pronunciation":["부르다"]},{"id":"bd8a8d233373a1c0","term":"대답","zh":"应答，回应，回复","audio":"/audio/bd8a8d233373a1c01779.mp3","entryId":"64540","definition":"对招呼的话做出回话；或指那样的话。","pronunciation":["대ː답"]},{"id":"a5443c04aa0fdc08","term":"빨리","zh":"快，赶快","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3","entryId":"57305","definition":"花费的时间不长地。","pronunciation":["빨리"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"b4d47e56735ffcb5","term":"혼나다","zh":"被大骂，被怒斥","audio":"/audio/b4d47e56735ffcb5a8a4.mp3","entryId":"87966","definition":"被严重指责或受罚。","pronunciation":["혼나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3120527af85dbb451a35.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64540-1-7-2","ko":"어른들이 부르시면 대답을 잘 해야지.","zh":"长辈叫话的时候，得好好回应才行。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어른들이","meaning":"长辈，长者","explanation":"어른：长辈，长者；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","read